# The control-api image builds with `services/` as its context because the
# binary embeds `tool-images/supervisor/supervisor.py`. Everything else in this
# folder is a different service's source and must not travel to the daemon:
# `control-api-rust/target` alone is several gigabytes.

**/target
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/__pycache__
**/.venv
**/.git
